id:                     E569
trigger_tool: cmake
phase: configuration
error_signature: Could NOT find XML2|Could NOT find ZLIB|FIND_LIBRARY.*NOTFOUND

# ═══ Layer 1: 识别层 (Recognition) ═══
# severity:      3=🔴blocking  2=🟡medium  1=🟢minor  0=✅resolved
# category:      分类标签（受控词表 64 词，逗号分隔，最多 5 个；add/promote 自动归一化）
# prescan_pattern: （可选）预编译源码扫描正则——写入后 PreScanner 运行时自动派生
#                   PSCAN-KB-{id} 规则，无需改 pre-scan-rules.yaml（知识增长即扫描能力增长）
# prescan_globs:   （可选）扫描范围 glob 列表，默认 '*.c, *.h, *.cc, *.cpp, *.sh, Makefile*, *.mk'
# 词表: platform, compat, limitation, detection, hmdfs, ohos, selinux, kernel, portability, libc, musl, posix, syscall, headers, threading, socket, network, build-system, cmake, autotools ...（全表见 scripts/ohc/kb_taxonomy.py）
# match_keywords: 纯文本关键词(逗号分隔), 用于粗筛(固定字符串匹配F)
# title:         简短标题(一句话描述错误模式)
severity: 2
category: build-system,cmake,conan,cross-compile
match_keywords: FIND_PATH,FIND_LIBRARY,XML2_INCLUDE_DIR,XML2_LIBRARY,cache variable,cpp_info
title: 老 CMakeLists 的 FIND_PATH/FIND_LIBRARY 写死 /usr 路径，交叉编译找不到依赖；用 cache_variables 注入同名变量即可，无需改上游脚本

# ═══ Layer 2: 诊断层 (Diagnosis) ═══
# root_cause:       一句话根因描述(逗号可分行)
# affected_scope:   影响范围
# verification_cmd: grep -E 'XML2_(INCLUDE_DIR|LIBRARY)|ZLIB_(INCLUDE_DIR|LIBRARY)' build/CMakeCache.txt && conan create . -pr:h=ohos-aarch64 -pr:b=ohos-aarch64 --build=missing 验证诊断是否正确的命令
root_cause: FIND_PATH(XML2_INCLUDE_DIR libxml/xmlreader.h /usr/local/include/libxml2 /usr/include/libxml2) 只在这些绝对路径查找；但 FIND_* 命中同名 cache 变量时直接采用，因此可在配方 generate() 阶段按 self.dependencies[dep].cpp_info 注入 <PKG>_INCLUDE_DIR/<PKG>_LIBRARY
affected_scope: 2000 年代手写 FIND_PATH/FIND_LIBRARY 的 CMake 工程（如 dictconv 0.2 的 src/CMakeLists.txt）交叉编译到 OHOS
verification_cmd: grep -E 'XML2_(INCLUDE_DIR|LIBRARY)|ZLIB_(INCLUDE_DIR|LIBRARY)' build/CMakeCache.txt && conan create . -pr:h=ohos-aarch64 -pr:b=ohos-aarch64 --build=missing

# ═══ Layer 3: 方案层 (Solution Space) ★ ═══
# 推荐方案 (priority 越小越优先, 从 1 开始)
rec_priority: 1
rec_approach: cache-variable-injection
rec_description: 在 conanfile generate() 用 tc.cache_variables 注入 XML2_INCLUDE_DIR/XML2_LIBRARY（值取 self.dependencies['libxml2'].cpp_info），比改上游 CMakeLists 侵入更小；静态依赖（zlib）显式指向 libz.a 以符合 R26
rec_command: conan create . -pr:h=ohos-aarch64 -pr:b=ohos-aarch64 --build=missing
rec_auto_fix: false
rec_impl: conan-recipe

# 回退方案 (当推荐方案不可用时尝试)
fallback_priority:      2
fallback_approach:
fallback_description:
fallback_command:
fallback_auto_fix:      false
fallback_impl:

